# Local experiment scripts — NEVER COMMIT.
# Added 2026-08-29. These files carry a hardcoded live DEEPSEEK_API_KEY
# (box_dream.py, box_dream2.py, box_dream3.py, p4_gate_v2.py,
# p4_gate_verify.py). This repo is PUBLIC. The directory has never been
# tracked and the key is not in history, so nothing is exposed — this rule
# exists so that a future `git add -A` cannot change that.
# Remove the key from the files before removing this rule.
/scripts/
